// 2007-base minus Changes: OSRS Transcript:Desert Treasure I "Talking to
// Eblis at the mirrors" — first hill Talk-to after village Excellent 8→10,
// before Look-into. Dump then return. Prefer 0 write: %deserttreasure
// stays 10. No %fd_mirror_present, no dest / Look-into, no 15, no AM, no
