[opnpc1,fd_elder_by_mirrors]
~chatplayer("<p,neutral>So can you give me any help on where to find these warriors and their diamonds?");
~chatnpc("<p,neutral>No, the magic used in this spell is powerful, but inaccurate. The direction the scrying glass faces is roughly the direction you will find the warrior, but I'm afraid I");
~chatnpc("<p,neutral>can't be any more help than that.");
~chatplayer("<p,neutral>I don't understand why there are six mirrors when there are only four diamonds...");
~chatnpc("<p,neutral>As I say, the enchantment is very inaccurate.");
~chatnpc("<p,neutral>I can only focus upon the aura the diamonds have left behind them, so any place where the Diamonds were present for a significant period of time will still be shown - such as the Bandit Camp where I make my home.");
~chatnpc("<p,neutral>My apologies, but magic is an inaccurate art in many respects.");
~chatnpc("<p,neutral>Don't forget to come back here when you have collected all four diamonds.");
return;
